<claims id="claims">
<claim id="CLM-00001" num="00001">
<claim-text>1. A wearable device comprising an optical sensor, an accelerometer, and a controller configured to raise a sampling rate of the optical sensor while the accelerometer reports motion.</claim-text>
</claim>
<claim id="CLM-00002" num="00002">
<claim-text>2. The device of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00001">claim 1</claim-ref>, wherein the controller discards samples captured while acceleration exceeds a threshold.</claim-text>
</claim>
