</claim>
<claim id="CLM-00002" num="00002">
<claim-text>2. The anode of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00001">claim 1</claim-ref>, wherein the silicon particles are 5 to 30 weight percent of the active material.</claim-text>
</claim>
<claim id="CLM-00003" num="00003">
<claim-text>3. A lithium-ion cell comprising a cathode, an electrolyte, and an anode having a cross-linked elastic binder lattice.</claim-text>
